# Voidstone networks: two lines of 16 Voidstone, apart. Motes put into the near end of one crawl
# along it, the whole line one network with room for 256; the other, touching nothing, stays empty.
function voidworks:gallery/clear
function voidworks:gallery/sign {scene:"voidstone_networks"}
fill ~5 ~ ~-6 ~20 ~ ~-6 voidworks:voidstone
fill ~5 ~ ~-9 ~20 ~ ~-9 voidworks:voidstone
# One grade above the End's Void Pressure over the open void, worth something wherever it is built.
voidworks mote ~5 ~ ~-6 5 64
